# Changelog

## 0.1.0 - 2026-11-27

Initial release.

- Wire-compatible Yar protocol header, request, response and MSGPACK packager.
- Blocking TCP / Unix-socket client with persistent connections.
- Tokio-based server with per-method handlers, bounded in-flight connections,
  idle and total request deadlines, and a bounded response write.
- File/stderr/pipe logger compatible with the C log format.
- Optional `profiler` feature with the C-vs-Rust benchmark tooling.
